+/**
+ * Four-point star.  `adj` is the OOXML `star4` inner-radius adjustment
+ * (the deck uses 8952 for the big stars and 11574 for the tiny ones);
+ * pptxgenjs cannot set that on a preset shape, so the outline is traced.
